id: scam-riches
name: Riches +1 (Scam)
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: the Scam Adventuring Maneuver's mark.
combatCondition: no
# "For 1 day" is story time, and nothing here counts days: the player ends it.
endedByHand: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Scam paid off: your Riches are 1 higher for a day.
text: >
  Riches +1 (Scam): the Scam Adventuring Maneuver's mark. "Increase your Riches by 1 for 1 day."

---

# Riches are not in this system yet: nothing reads this mark. It keeps the "+1 for 1 day" in view until
# the day is over and it is ended - Cancel buff on the Scam row, or from the Combat tab.
